		{
			dependencies: ["5B064A6634A46338"]
			description: ["The &6Stellar Fractionation Hall&r runs distillation tower and distillery recipes, one mode at a time, and is the UXV member of the mega family. About 1,820 gum metal and 200 pulsed field casings, a parallel hatch behind it and the power for its width. Pick the mode in the controller. The shape is about 61 by 21 by 21 and about 3,270 blocks: GTM's Terminal places about 2,300 blocks per pass, so a structure this large takes two. Every distillation line of the pack on a single machine. One input bus per fluid, one output hatch per cut."]
			icon: "gtceu:stellar_fractionation_hall"
			id: "3CDE309DC5358AFF"
			rewards: [{ id: "717A052ED52E0FEC", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
