			title: "Sixteen Amps of UXV"
			x: 12.5d
			y: -14.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14B0B5EA38F22432"]
			description: ["The &6Cryogenic Plant&r, &6Rare Earth Extraction Cascade&r, &6Platinum Plant&r, &6Hot Strip Mill&r, &6Syngas and Shift Plant&r and &6Fluorspar Kiln&r each take a new mode: stellar helium and oxygen fuels, knot dust and flux dross, sputter-grade platinum, foils and laminations, platform syngas and fluorine. The controllers you already own, and cuts and dust from the stars. The Mk6 fuels, the titanium-44 line and the targets of the spintronic lane. Each plant hands its product on by pipe. Return the nitrogen and the water."]
			icon: "gtceu:cryogenic_plant"
			id: "175BA546E30279E1"
			rewards: [{ id: "597AE1215C20F5B2", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
