		{
			dependencies: ["3B0561CB951B62B9"]
			description: ["The &6HTS Magnet Works&r, &6Coated Conductor Line&r, &6Naquadria Magnet Works&r, &6Nitride Magnet Works&r and &6Powder Bed Printer&r each take a row for the era: strand stators, strand tape, rotors, field anneals and sputter targets. The UEV and older controllers, and strand wire from Vela for the first two. The motor, the conveyor, the field generator and every spintronic target. Targets by bus; give back the copper backing plates of spent ones."]
			icon: "gtceu:hts_magnet_works"
