			x: 17.5d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7F876A1037924C13"]
			description: ["Both runs of this age fire the same bullet: titanium-50, the rare isotope of titanium. The ion source burns one oven charge per run. The pyroprocessing cell turns enriched titanium-50 chloride and magnesium into sponge (circuit 6). The levitation melter melts the sponge under helium into titanium-50 dust (circuit 3). An assembler (200 ticks, circuit 29) presses the dust with a titanium foil into the oven charge. The Element 121 and Element 122 runs in the Superheavy Factory. Chloride and magnesium by ME; the charge is small, so make a stack at a time and stock it beside the factory."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:ti50_oven_charge"
			id: "5AF879F7A50C63BE"
			rewards: [{ id: "7BA9959E35BD40D2", type: "xp", xp: 180 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "5AF3A9E69E9CEC74", item: "gtceu:titanium_50_dust", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7D62A5B9F85A82A3", item: "grindless:ti50_oven_charge", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Titanium-50 Beam Charge"
			x: 15.0d
			y: -7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5AF879F7A50C63BE", "75CFD23128DE819C"]
			description: ["One factory, two targets. An einsteinium-254 target struck by the titanium beam gives element 121; a fermium-257 target gives element 122. The census III asks for both. In the &6Superheavy Factory&r, a target, an oven charge, an Nb3Sn SRF cavity and helium (circuit 9 for 121, circuit 10 for 122) make the recoil gas; each run takes 48,000 ticks. The same factory then separates the atoms with an etched membrane (2,400 ticks, circuits 8 and 9). The chemistry lab seals each batch in a capsule (circuit 8 and 9), and Census III joins both, with Census II (circuit 10). The Superheavy Census III, and with it the island chart. Run both targets in one factory on a schedule; the atoms live a few seconds, so pipe the gas to the lab by ME and never store it."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:element_122_recoil"
			id: "7C6AF6956C2E7314"
			rewards: [{ id: "3B21C4E41BA7B703", type: "xp", xp: 260 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "51A514580283C463", item: "grindless:element_121_recoil", type: "item" }
				{ id: "705D094F1B41CD16", item: "grindless:element_122_recoil", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1D7767E021DE480A", item: "grindless:superheavy_census_iii", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Elements 121 and 122"
			x: 18.5d
			y: -5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["78B28FCF40BA6381"]
			description: ["The machines of the era and the first steps that put each one to work."]
			icon: "minecraft:writable_book"
			id: "77ECA9A3DDFB480D"
			rewards: [ ]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
