		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1887C02641FE7714"]
			description: ["A field-reversed configuration is a smoke ring of plasma that holds its own field. The &6FRC Former&r shoots one into a cartridge and keeps it there. A UIV hull, about 690 gum metal and 460 pulsed field casings, a formation tube and a capacitor bank. The shape is about 41 by 13 by 13 and about 1,540 blocks. The FRC cartridge: travel to Vela, the field generator and the gate all use one. Disk plasma by pipe; cartridges are consumed, so stock a generous chest."]
			icon: "gtceu:frc_former"
			id: "518B1C106BB5136F"
