			title: "FRC Former"
			x: 22.5d
			y: 9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["518B1C106BB5136F"]
			description: ["A spinning black hole threaded by a magnetic field drives a current, and the hole slows down to pay for it. The &6BZ Dynamo&r burns flux-loaded plasma that way. A UIV hull, about 1,400 gum metal and 790 pulsed field casings, and a flux loop inside the torus. The shape is about 41 by 9 by 41 and about 2,470 blocks: GTM's Terminal places about 2,300 blocks per pass, so a structure this large takes two. Power at Cygnus X-1, with no fuel but the plasma. Feed flux-loaded plasma by pipe and ship the power home over the wireless link."]
			icon: "gtceu:bz_dynamo"
			id: "3611A4EAC7D055C3"
			rewards: [{ id: "1615166934B28465", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
