		}
		{
			dependencies: ["762148FD60F92F5F"]
			description: ["The two membranes are joined to the bus, the wafer is closed with its top copper and gold layers, and a cutter dices it. Each die holds the logic, the memory and the bus of one mainframe. The vdW stacker joins the bus and the switch (ME-on-spin wafer, circuit 7, 700 ticks) and lays the readout over it (MESO spin wafer, circuit 8). The Photonic Foundry caps it with copper and gold (circuit 30). The cutter dices it with lubricant. The spintronic mainframe. Lubricant by pipe; dice a stack at a time and send the dies straight to the integration hall."]
			icon: "grindless:spintronic_die"
