		{
			dependencies: ["70A10FA0091DD583", "399C5261E9B68BA2", "7AC8ABCAA1CCFF90"]
			description: ["The end of the line: a mainframe that computes in spin waves. It is the circuit every UXV machine asks for. The Photonic Integration Hall (3,000 ticks, circuit 7): a spintronic die, an MTJ die, a shielded interposer and UIV circuits. The interposer is a mu-metal shield can on a glass interposer, soldered in the Photonic Foundry (circuit 22). The UXV circuit chain and every UXV machine that needs it. Dies and interposers by ME; the hall takes one of each per mainframe."]
